; IPC 2020/2023 hierarchical plan format. The grounded action "load crate depot"
; occurs twice (ids 0 and 2) under two distinct method occurrences; the witness
; must keep both, never collapse them into one.
==>
0 load crate depot
1 unload crate dock
2 load crate depot
3 unload crate dock
root 4
4 __top -> __top_method 5 6
5 deliver crate depot dock -> m-deliver-direct 0 1
6 deliver crate depot dock -> m-deliver-direct 2 3
<==
